SUMMARY:August meetup! Speaker\, networking\, swag\, food and beverages
DESCRIPTION:All Things Open RTP Meetup\nOur August meetup will take place 
 Wednesday evening\, August 5!\n\nMore details are coming soon\, but RSVP n
 ow to save your spot!\n\nWe'll be back at The Barn at Bandwidth's RTP camp
 us. It's a world-class venue and it's one our community LOVES visiting!\n\
 nDoors open at 6:00 pm for networking\, swag\, and food and beverages. Liv
 e programming kicks off at 6:30 sharp.\n\nLocation:\nThe Barn at Bandwidth
  Raleigh office\n2230 Bandmate Way\nRaleigh\, NC 27607\n**[Additional Venu
 e Details](https://www.bandwidth.com/bandmate-way/)**\, including parking\
 n*\\*note\, additional visitor parking will be available onsite on the 27t
 h*\n\n**Questions?** Contact us at [info@allthingsopen.org.](http://info@a
 llthingsopen.org./)\n\n**RSVP required**\n\\*This is a free event. However
 \, an RSVP is required. Seating is limited\, so RSVP's will be capped as w
 e fill up. Please move quickly and RSVP to save your spot if interested. W
 hen you RSVP you will be added to our mailing list to receive future event
  updates. You can unsubscribe at any time.
